--- !u!114 &462245845636889063
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6206343230446126427}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 0.5019608, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: d8a7948bc83b01f45ab5078c10dd8e04, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 80
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 118
    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 0
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 1
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '

    You may pocket from any target ball.



    The number of the pocketed
    ball is the score.



    If you pocketed it in a side pocket, you get double
    points.



    If the pocket is not reached, the turn is passed to the opposing
    team.



    If the cueball does not hit any target ball, it is a foul.



    If
    the cueball falls into the pocket or out of the pool, it is a foul.



    If
    you foul, you will not receive any points. (0 points)



    If you foul, the
    turn is passed to the opposing team as a free ball.



    The team with the
    most points is the winner when all target balls are pocketed.



    The final
    shot gets double the score.



    If there is a tie, the winner is the team
    that drops the last ball without fouling.



    If the score was tied and you
    fouled and pocketed the last ball, you lose.



    Team members can be changed
    during the game.



    Individual player scores are reset when team members
    are changed.



    When only the orange team of players is present, the game
    will enter the practice mode.'
